%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant API as Trading API
    participant K as Kafka
    participant E as Execution Engine

    C->>API: Place order (REST + JWT)
    Note over API: Validate & save (NEW)
    API-->>C: Order accepted
    API->>K: publish to "orders"
    K->>E: consume order
    Note over E: Simulate fill<br/>0.5–2s delay, price improvement
    E->>K: publish to "executions"
    K->>API: consume execution
    Note over API: Settle: FILLED<br/>+ cash balance updated

    Note over API,E: Failed messages go to .DLT topics · stuck orders auto-republished
